      "message": "\u003e I wouldn\u0027t mind if the \"don\u0027t check NewApi for libcore\" was in a separate CL\n\nGood point, I have created aosp/1977412 to limit the scope of the current CL\n\n\n\u003e Unclear to me if this actually disables NewApi-linting or just disables enforcing of checkStrictUpdatabilityLinting, though?\n\nIIUC, it is the latter. strict_udpatability_linting is not propagated to the libcore/ library from this mutator. If the libcore/ library explicitly lists `lint{strict_udpatability_linting: true}` in their Android.bp file, they will not be allowed to disable NewApi linting",
